/-!
# Compact table certificate for the 93 rate-half base directions

Coordinates 6 and 15 form a common projective chart for the three-core base
defects.  This file records the 93 values `coordinate_15 / coordinate_6` and
kernel-checks that they are in the certified prime field and pairwise distinct.

The separate evaluation certificate must identify these constants with the
actual reduced Lagrange defects.  Keeping the table and evaluation layers
separate prevents giant inverse expressions from overwhelming kernel reduction.
-/

